                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]It's a cat on a diet and it wants to eat you. Wait, no, that's not it.[/h2]\r\n\r\nSo, you play as a cat, and no, he's not on a diet, he's just fat. This game drove me bonkers but then most of the cat games I've played do. I'm starting to notice a pattern.\r\n\r\nShould you play it? Maybe... only if you're okay with it basically being a ported mobile game... with fat cats. No really if you like puzzle games and cats, then yes, yes you maybe should.\r\n\r\nJust don't go hunting for achievements, I say that a lot these days mostly cause I don't want competition. Wait maybe that was the point all along!\r\n\r\n[h2]6.5/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h3][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h3]",
